---
import { SITE } from '../data';
---
<section class="rw-shared-cta">
  <div class="container rw-shared-cta-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="rw-shared-cta-kicker">A MORE INFORMED WAY TO MOVE</span>
      <h2>Wherever you're headed,<br /><em>start with a clearer plan.</em></h2>
      <p>Explore our free destination guides, then turn to the separate Substack newsletter for dated international job research and original employer application links.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rw-shared-cta-actions">
      <a class="rw-btn rw-btn-light" href="/countries">Explore country guides <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="rw-shared-cta-link" href={SITE.substackUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read weekly jobs on Substack <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
